msgid "Host key fingerprint (ED25519)"
msgstr "主机密钥指纹（ED25519）"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info the host key"
msgid "Generating…"
msgstr "正在生成…"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sign-in methods"
msgstr "登录方式"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Your account password, or a public key in ~/.ssh/authorized_keys"
msgstr "账户密码，或 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys 中的公钥"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Services masked by default"
msgstr "默认屏蔽的服务"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Why they are masked"
msgstr "为什么屏蔽"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Android does what these services would do, or they have no use on this device. Allowing one only removes its mask: if it is enabled, it runs at the next boot or when something calls it. Turning it off masks it again and stops it at once."
msgstr "这些服务的功能由 Android 负责，或者在本机没有作用。允许运行只是解除屏蔽：已启用的服务会在下次开机或被调用时运行。关闭会重新屏蔽并立即停止。"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Other masked services"
msgstr "其他被屏蔽的服务"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Not on Rungic's list. Tap to unmask."
msgstr "不在 Rungic 的清单里，点按解除屏蔽"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Masked by Ubuntu"
msgstr "Ubuntu 自带的屏蔽"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info no masks"
msgid "None"
msgstr "无"

#: ui/main.qml
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "Placeholders for old init scripts, not services that actually run. They can't be changed here."
msgstr "旧式启动脚本的兼容占位，不是实际运行的服务，不能在这里更改。"

#: policy.json
msgid "SSH login"
msgstr "SSH 远程登录"

#: policy.json
msgid "When on, devices on the same local network can sign in with this device's Linux account password or an SSH key (the phone's IP address, port 22)."
msgstr "开启后，同一局域网内的设备可以用本机 Linux 账户的密码或 SSH 密钥登录（手机的 IP 地址，端口 22）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "When on, anyone on the local network can try to sign in with the account password. Make sure the password is strong, and turn this on only on networks you trust."
msgstr "开启后，局域网内的任何人都可以尝试用账户密码登录。请确认账户密码足够强，只在可信的网络中开启。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Own network (as the Rungic app)"
msgstr "独立网络（以 Rungic 应用身份联网）"

#: policy.json
msgid "Linux connects to the network as the Rungic app: VPN apps such as SwiftWire or Clash apply the rules you set for Rungic to all of Linux, as to any app (docs/116). When off, Linux shares Android's network directly, and VPNs may treat its system traffic differently. A change takes effect when Rungic next starts."
msgstr "Linux 以 Rungic 这个应用的身份联网：SwiftWire、Clash 等 VPN 应用对 Rungic 设的规则，会对整个 Linux 生效，和其他应用一样（docs/116）。关闭后，Linux 直接共用安卓的网络，VPN 可能会特殊对待它的系统流量。更改在 Rungic 下次启动时生效。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Turned off, Linux traffic does not follow the VPN rules you set for Rungic, and some VPNs break its system services' connections."
msgstr "关闭后，Linux 的流量不再遵循你给 Rungic 设的 VPN 规则，有些 VPN 会让它的系统服务连不上网。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Docker (rootless)"
msgstr "Docker（rootless）"

#: policy.json
msgid "Docker running as the current user (rootless mode), with bridge networking, published ports and Compose. Images and data are in /var/lib/rungic-docker/<user UID>. Memory and CPU limits for individual containers are not supported: Android's resource controllers are not on cgroup v2 (docs/85)."
msgstr "以当前用户身份运行的 Docker（rootless 模式），支持 bridge 网络、端口发布和 Compose。镜像与数据在 /var/lib/rungic-docker/<用户 UID>。不支持单个容器的内存、CPU 限制：Android 的资源控制器不在 cgroup v2 上（docs/85）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Published ports are reachable on all of the phone's networks, so devices on the same local network can connect. Publish only the services that need to be reachable."
msgstr "发布的端口在手机的所有网络上都可访问，同一局域网内的设备可以连接。只发布需要对外提供的服务。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Docker system service (rootful)"
msgstr "Docker 系统服务（rootful）"

#: policy.json
msgid "The docker and containerd services that docker.io runs as root. Containers share the network with Android and have no net_admin, so they cannot start this way; use the rootless Docker above (docs/85)."
msgstr "docker.io 自带的以 root 运行的 docker 与 containerd。容器与 Android 共用网络且没有 net_admin，这种方式下容器无法启动；请使用上面的 rootless Docker（docs/85）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "It needs permission to manage the network, and this container shares network interfaces with Android. Even when allowed, it cannot run containers and only keeps reporting errors."
msgstr "它需要管理网络的权限，而本容器与 Android 共用网卡。即使放开也无法运行容器，只会反复报错。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android manages the network. Rungic's network compatibility service holds the D-Bus name org.freedesktop.NetworkManager and gives Linux apps Android's network state (docs/research/32)."
msgstr "网络由 Android 管理。Rungic 的网络兼容服务占用 org.freedesktop.NetworkManager 这个 D-Bus 名称，向 Linux 应用提供 Android 的网络状态（docs/research/32）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "The container shares network interfaces with Android. The real NetworkManager may take over Wi-Fi, cutting the phone's connection and wireless debugging, and it conflicts with Rungic's network compatibility service."
msgstr "容器与 Android 共用网卡。真正的 NetworkManager 可能接管 Wi-Fi，导致手机断网、无线调试断开，也会和 Rungic 的网络兼容服务冲突。"

#: policy.json
msgid "systemd-networkd and netplan"
msgstr "systemd-networkd 与 netplan"

#: policy.json
msgid "Ubuntu's network configuration services. Android manages network interfaces, addresses and routes."
msgstr "Ubuntu 的网卡配置服务。网卡、地址和路由由 Android 管理。"

#: policy.json
msgid "The container shares network interfaces with Android. These services may change interface addresses and routes, cutting the phone's connection and wireless debugging."
msgstr "容器与 Android 共用网卡。它们可能改动网卡地址和路由，导致手机断网、无线调试断开。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android handles DNS."
msgstr "域名解析由 Android 负责。"

#: policy.json
msgid "It may take over DNS settings, leaving Linux apps unable to resolve domain names."
msgstr "它可能接管 DNS 设置，导致 Linux 应用无法解析域名。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android's own wpa_supplicant manages Wi-Fi connections."
msgstr "Wi-Fi 连接由 Android 自己的 wpa_supplicant 管理。"

#: policy.json
msgid "A second wpa_supplicant in the container competes for the same Wi-Fi interface and may cut the phone's connection and wireless debugging."
msgstr "容器里再运行一个 wpa_supplicant 会争用同一块 Wi-Fi 网卡，可能导致手机断网、无线调试断开。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android's RIL manages the modem. Rungic's mobile network compatibility service holds org.freedesktop.ModemManager1 (docs/73)."
msgstr "调制解调器由 Android 的 RIL 管理。Rungic 的移动网络兼容服务占用 org.freedesktop.ModemManager1（docs/73）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "It competes with Rungic's mobile network compatibility service for the same D-Bus name, and Linux settings may stop showing the SIM card and signal."
msgstr "会和 Rungic 的移动网络兼容服务争用同一个 D-Bus 名称，Linux 设置里可能看不到 SIM 卡和信号。"

#: policy.json
msgid "BlueZ Bluetooth service"
msgstr "BlueZ 蓝牙服务"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android manages Bluetooth, and the container has no Bluetooth controller. Rungic's Bluetooth compatibility service holds org.bluez (docs/73)."
msgstr "蓝牙由 Android 管理，容器里没有蓝牙控制器。Rungic 的蓝牙兼容服务占用 org.bluez（docs/73）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "It competes with Rungic's Bluetooth compatibility service for org.bluez, and Bluetooth settings on the Linux side may stop working."
msgstr "会和 Rungic 的蓝牙兼容服务争用 org.bluez，Linux 侧的蓝牙设置可能失效。"

#: policy.json
msgid "chrony time sync"
msgstr "chrony 时间同步"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android keeps the system time in sync. The container and Android share the same kernel clock."
msgstr "系统时间由 Android 同步。容器与 Android 共用同一个内核时钟。"

#: policy.json
msgid "When chrony adjusts the time, it changes the time of the whole phone and may conflict with Android's time sync."
msgstr "chrony 调整时间会改变整台手机的时间，可能与 Android 的时间同步冲突。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Android manages performance and power saving."
msgstr "性能与省电策略由 Android 管理。"

#: policy.json
msgid "It cannot actually switch the phone's performance mode, and Settings may show power modes that do nothing."
msgstr "它无法真正切换手机的性能模式，设置里可能出现无效的电源模式。"

#: policy.json
msgid "PowerDevil (user service)"
msgstr "PowerDevil（用户服务）"

#: policy.json
msgid "The reason for masking it was not recorded separately. Android manages the screen and power."
msgstr "屏蔽原因没有单独记录。屏幕与电源由 Android 管理。"

#: policy.json
msgid "The reason for masking it was not recorded; the effect of turning it on is unknown."
msgstr "屏蔽原因没有记录，开启后的影响未知。"

#: policy.json
msgid "KDE session manager (ksmserver)"
msgstr "KDE 会话管理（ksmserver）"

#: policy.json
msgid "Masked by hand for the first user before 2026-09-26, with no reason recorded; since then it is the same for all users (docs/61)."
msgstr "2026-09-26 之前为第一个用户手动屏蔽，原因没有记录；之后所有用户保持一致（docs/61）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "X11 tray and menu proxies"
msgstr "X11 托盘与菜单代理"

#: policy.json
msgid "They only serve X11 programs, and the session has no X server."
msgstr "只为 X11 程序服务，会话没有 X 服务器。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Bluetooth file transfer (obexd)"
msgstr "蓝牙文件传输（obexd）"

#: policy.json
msgid "The container has no Bluetooth controller (docs/73)."
msgstr "容器里没有蓝牙控制器（docs/73）。"

#: policy.json
msgid "First-boot setup for Ubuntu cloud images. This device is not a cloud server."
msgstr "Ubuntu 云镜像的首次开机配置。本机不是云主机。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Snap package service"
msgstr "Snap 软件包服务"

#: policy.json
msgid "Software is installed with apt and Flatpak. Snap has not been tested in the container."
msgstr "软件通过 apt 和 Flatpak 安装。Snap 在容器里未经验证。"

#: policy.json
msgid "Console login terminals"
msgstr "控制台登录终端"

#: policy.json
msgid "The container has no physical console."
msgstr "容器没有物理控制台。"

#: policy.json
msgid "TPM device rules"
msgstr "TPM 设备规则"

#: policy.json
msgid "The phone has no TPM security chip."
msgstr "手机没有 TPM 安全芯片。"
